ht, and puzzle your way through this wondrous zoo rescue mission!",
    "short_description": "Join Shawley on a magical rescue mission in &quot;Shawley - Zoo of Wonders&quot;! Navigate through enchanted worlds, defeat foes with your hammer, unlock new skills and save escaped animals to reopen the zoo. A grant platformer adventure full of fun and excitement awaits!",
